who's lives in Niigata.

02:08:48.430 --> 02:08:50.790
And he's a crazy guy.

02:08:50.790 --> 02:08:51.623
He's great. I love him.

02:08:51.623 --> 02:08:52.940
He's amazing. He's so funny.

02:08:52.940 --> 02:08:53.773
He's really, really rich.

02:08:53.773 --> 02:08:54.870
- He is a proper lad, he is.

02:08:54.870 --> 02:08:57.640
- And he's up in Niigata
in the middle of Japan

02:08:57.640 --> 02:08:59.130
and he's half Japanese, half Welsh,

02:08:59.130 --> 02:09:00.577
and he's just a fake priest

02:09:00.577 --> 02:09:01.623
and I think I've spoken on it before

02:09:01.623 --> 02:09:02.651
that my friend's a fake priest.

02:09:02.651 --> 02:09:03.484
- Yeah, yeah.
- Yeah.

02:09:03.484 --> 02:09:04.910
- But like he teaches English

02:09:04.910 --> 02:09:06.070
and then he's also a fake priest

02:09:06.070 --> 02:09:07.360
and that's just what he likes doing.

02:09:07.360 --> 02:09:09.550
But he also just doesn't really care about

02:09:09.550 --> 02:09:10.860
being in one place for too long.

02:09:10.860 --> 02:09:12.130
He's like, I'll just kind of go wherever-

02:09:12.130 --> 02:09:13.020
- Just a wanderer.

02:09:13.020 --> 02:09:14.350
- He literally just goes places

02:09:14.350 --> 02:09:15.470
and he's like, "All
right, what's going on?

02:09:15.470 --> 02:09:16.750
Let's figure it out. Let's
try and get a job here."

02:09:16.750 --> 02:09:18.465
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.
- He just doesn't give a fuck.

02:09:18.465 --> 02:09:21.120
- I have a friend who is
similar to that who lives here.

02:09:21.120 --> 02:09:22.623
- I couldn't do that.

02:09:23.653 --> 02:09:25.363
But he's bad ass, he just turns up

02:09:25.363 --> 02:09:26.934
and does what he wants, it's great.

02:09:26.934 --> 02:09:30.086
And he's always super
happy and super optimistic

02:09:30.086 --> 02:09:32.616
and I'm like, "Are you
British? Are you really?

02:09:32.616 --> 02:09:34.180
You grew up in the UK, right?

02:09:34.180 --> 02:09:35.013
How are you this optimistic?"

02:09:35.013 --> 02:09:35.846
- It's the Japanese side that's kicking.

02:09:35.846 --> 02:09:37.330
- Yeah, he just turns up.

02:09:37.330 --> 02:09:38.560
He's like, "Yeah, what's going on?"

02:09:38.560 --> 02:09:40.620
Always has a good time,
talks to anyone he meets.

02:09:40.620 --> 02:09:42.248
It's just like, yeah.

02:09:42.248 --> 02:09:44.060
- I feel people like that are usually

02:09:44.060 --> 02:09:46.013
like the most optimistic
people in the planet, right?

02:09:46.013 --> 02:09:48.600
Because I have a friend
like that who was like,

02:09:48.600 --> 02:09:51.880
he's an animator for an anime studio here.

02:09:51.880 --> 02:09:52.713
He did like the,

02:09:52.713 --> 02:09:54.247
I met him through like
the Pop Team Epic stuff.

02:09:54.247 --> 02:09:56.810
But like he also just like goes out.

02:09:56.810 --> 02:09:58.590
He's just like, "I'm just
gonna go on a road trip

02:09:58.590 --> 02:10:00.820
for a month and just like
try and make some money

02:10:00.820 --> 02:10:02.410
along the way and just see what happens."

02:10:02.410 --> 02:10:06.350
