02:10:18.703 --> 02:10:20.806
I could not bring myself to just be like,

02:10:20.806 --> 02:10:22.330
I don't know where I'm gonna be tomorrow.

02:10:22.330 --> 02:10:23.163
- Yeah.
- I don't know

02:10:23.163 --> 02:10:24.010
what I'm gonna do tomorrow.

02:10:24.010 --> 02:10:24.843
I couldn't do that myself.
- Yeah,

02:10:24.843 --> 02:10:25.676
I couldn't do that either.

02:10:25.676 --> 02:10:26.890
I need like some,

02:10:26.890 --> 02:10:28.490
like at least a little bit of a plan.

02:10:28.490 --> 02:10:29.569
- I need some kind of direction.

02:10:29.569 --> 02:10:30.523
Yeah, yeah,
- I like plans. I like plans.

02:10:30.523 --> 02:10:31.765
- I like plans.

02:10:31.765 --> 02:10:34.960
- I used to like spreadsheet
all my like spending

02:10:34.960 --> 02:10:37.090
in university, like to the penny

02:10:37.090 --> 02:10:39.530
and I would have like a prediction
of my spending coming up

02:10:39.530 --> 02:10:41.937
