some money in university,

02:10:47.470 --> 02:10:48.540
I was like, "Oh my God, this is amazing."

02:10:48.540 --> 02:10:50.230
I was like, "I don't need
the spreadsheet anymore.

02:10:50.230 --> 02:10:51.063
Fuck this."

02:10:51.063 --> 02:10:55.960
Why am I like spending hours a week

02:10:55.960 --> 02:10:57.837
