02:10:57.837 --> 02:10:58.670
It doesn't fucking matter anyway

02:10:58.670 --> 02:10:59.681
'cause I'm not gonna spend that much.

02:10:59.681 --> 02:11:01.332
- Yeah.
- It doesn't fucking matter.

02:11:01.332 --> 02:11:03.410
- Oh my God.
- Yeah.

02:11:03.410 --> 02:11:05.300
- Yeah and like to go
off what we were saying.

02:11:05.300 --> 02:11:07.470
I'm not saying like there's no place

02:11:07.470 --> 02:11:09.668
for higher education and
university or everything-

02:11:09.668 --> 02:11:10.850
- I'm still glad I went.

02:11:10.850 --> 02:11:12.300
- Yeah, I mean, I'm still glad I went

02:11:12.300 --> 02:11:14.290
but what I'm saying is like

02:11:14.290 --> 02:11:16.260
don't feel the pressure to need to go

02:11:16.260 --> 02:11:17.093
