02:11:28.254 --> 02:11:30.430
Your birthday has ticked over.

02:11:30.430 --> 02:11:31.504
You are now an adult.

02:11:31.504 --> 02:11:33.647
You need to know everything now.

02:11:33.647 --> 02:11:35.440
